probe opens raw HID nodes on your Alienware/Darfon/etc. devices to test lights.
If anything goes wrong, from another terminal or SSH session:
  sudo pkill alienfx_cli
and if a keyboard stops responding, rebind its usbhid driver, e.g.:
  echo -n '<bus-port:iface>' | sudo tee /sys/bus/usb/drivers/usbhid/bind
Run `alienfx_cli probe --dry-run` first to see what would be opened.

